  "translation": "Na yu bai wokim ⟨את⟩ graun bilong en — yu, ol pikinini bilong yu, na ol wokman bilong yu; na yu bai bringim kaikai i kam, na bai i kamap kaikai bilong pikinini bilong bikman bilong yu, na em bai kaikai. Na Mefiboset, pikinini bilong bikman bilong yu, bai kaikai bret oltaim long tebol bilong mi. (Na Tsiva i gat fiftipela pikinini na twentipela wokman.)",
